WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.190
- You used to carry something
in your wallet I hear.

00:00:02.190 --> 00:00:03.820
What did you carry in your wallet?

00:00:03.820 --> 00:00:07.509
- Just a casual laminated
photo of Leo DiCaprio.

00:00:07.509 --> 00:00:09.571
(Kelly laughs)

00:00:09.571 --> 00:00:10.720
I don't think it's...

00:00:11.571 --> 00:00:13.880
- [Kelly] What, a casual?

00:00:13.880 --> 00:00:14.713
- [Eliza] No like it was...

00:00:14.713 --> 00:00:18.240
- You have casual and laminated,
those don't exist together.

00:00:18.240 --> 00:00:21.080
- Laminating things was like very big,

00:00:21.080 --> 00:00:23.270
back when I was in middle school.

00:00:23.270 --> 00:00:25.820
And in the library at my high school,

00:00:25.820 --> 00:00:27.640
I was in high school, I guess.

00:00:27.640 --> 00:00:30.570
So this goes, I wasn't
as young as I should be

00:00:30.570 --> 00:00:33.040
to be doing this, it was just last year.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:36.690
Just last year. Let me get it.

00:00:36.690 --> 00:00:38.890
No, I laminated this photo of him

00:00:38.890 --> 00:00:40.430
'cause I loved this photo of him.

00:00:40.430 --> 00:00:42.840
And I was like, it was from
like Teen Bop Magazine.

00:00:42.840 --> 00:00:44.570
And I was like, no, this
is gonna get ripped.

00:00:44.570 --> 00:00:45.980
This is, this is,

00:00:45.980 --> 00:00:47.490
it was so-
- It was like The Bible.

00:00:47.490 --> 00:00:48.980
- I'm saying this out loud. I know.

00:00:48.980 --> 00:00:49.813
I'm saying this out loud

00:00:49.813 --> 00:00:51.066
and I'm a little concerned for myself.

00:00:51.066 --> 00:00:52.510
(Kelly laughs)

00:00:52.510 --> 00:00:55.180
- I think plenty of
girls had Leo laminated.

00:00:55.180 --> 00:00:57.525
- Yeah. But like, we were
in a legit relationship.

00:00:57.525 --> 00:00:58.968
(Kelly laughs)

00:00:58.968 --> 00:00:59.950
- He didn't know.

00:00:59.950 --> 00:01:01.320
- He had no idea.
- Yeah.

00:01:01.320 --> 00:01:02.580
- He had no idea.
- No, it was fine.

00:01:02.580 --> 00:01:04.490
It was a great moment though.
- Yeah.

00:01:04.490 --> 00:01:06.860
- I love that you carried it around.

00:01:06.860 --> 00:01:08.310
We all have our weird things.

